Z||000000||MontanaFiero||08-29-2001||01:05 PM||||I've seen a lot of talk on using a mustang hood scoop on the Fiero decklid to aid in cooling. I like the scoop the fiero shop has for $225 here &gt;&gt;&gt; <A HREF="http://www.thefieroshop.com/catalog/trunk_scoop.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.thefieroshop.com/catalog/trunk_scoop.htm</A>  but, I'm not ready to spend that much. <P><B>I would like to see a picture of a Fiero with a mustang scoop on the decklid.</B> I would also like to see any other trick venting ideas that have been done.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/blee291/fiero/mtfieroplate.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by MontanaFiero (edited 08-29-2001).]||||reg||1
